WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.256
Identify, explain and apply the important ideas behind your digital footprint.

00:00:06.117 --> 00:00:11.302
Respect: means communicating without insults. Permission: is needed before sharing

00:00:11.302 --> 00:00:12.858
another person's photo.

00:00:13.700 --> 00:00:18.966
Digital footprint: is information left by online activity. Report: tells a trusted

00:00:18.966 --> 00:00:22.916
adult about online harm. Pause: means thinking before posting.

00:00:23.783 --> 00:00:28.647
Use an imaginary example or a teacher-approved offline screenshot. Discuss when to

00:00:28.647 --> 00:00:34.322
use respect and permission. Never enter a real password or share private details in

00:00:34.322 --> 00:00:35.133
this activity.
